/Alt (Two pictures are displayed side-by-side. On the left is an unsafe manoeuvre: a silent failure or potential crash ahead, as the pathway indicates that the ego-vehicle will not stop and give way to the car on the roundabout. On the right is a safe manoeuvre: no potential crash ahead, as the pathway indicates that the ego-vehicle will stop and give way to the car on the roundabout.)
